note: Calculator Example (calculator.vibe)
note: Azra has no keyboard-input primitive, so this example uses set values.

note: Import math helpers
use "math.vibe"

set a to 8
set b to 2

say "Sum: " + add with a, b
say "Difference: " + sub with a, b
say "Product: " + mul with a, b
if b not_equals 0:
    say "Quotient: " + div with a, b
otherwise:
    say "Cannot divide by zero"
